Marquee changes (each changed spot carries a "Marquee fork" comment), for the
address policy of plans/c27-torrent-policy.md section 11:

- src/socket.rs: `Permits`, a check on source addresses, and
  `SocketOpts::permits`, copied into the validated options. The first lines of
  `Dispatcher::on_recv` drop a datagram whose source the check refuses, so a
  refused source reaches no stream and gets no SYN-ACK, RESET or connect ACK.
- src/lib.rs: exports `Permits`.
